sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Velocity Developer
    participant Git as Central GitOps Repo
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    actor Approver as Data Team / Approver
    participant Store as Artifact Store (ConfigMap/S3)
    participant Engine as Translation Engine (TaaS)

    Dev->>Git: Update velocity_funding.jsonata & Open PR
    Git->>CI: Trigger validation pipeline
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over CI: Automated Governance Gate
        CI->>Git: Fetch Data Team's Canonical JSON Schema
        CI->>CI: Execute updated JSONata against Mock Native Events
        CI->>CI: Validate output against Canonical Schema
    end
    
    alt Validation Fails
        CI-->>Git: Mark build as FAILED (Block PR)
        Git-->>Dev: Notify validation error
    else Validation Succeeds
        CI-->>Git: Mark build as SUCCESS
        Approver->>Git: Review & Merge PR to main
        Git->>CI: Trigger deployment pipeline
        CI->>Store: Publish validated .jsonata files
        Store-->>Engine: Config update event (or Engine polling)
        Engine->>Store: Fetch new .jsonata configuration
        Engine->>Engine: Dynamically update mapping cache (No Restart)
    end
